<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - C/NET raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - C/NET raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robertson Stephens &amp; Co research analyst Keith Benjamin raised C/Net Inc to buy from long-term attractive.</p>
<p>-- Benjamin said new revenue streams, including shopping transaction revenues for C/Net, an internet content company, appear promising.</p>
<p>-- Shares were trading at 20-1/2, up 3/8, in exchange trading.</p>
</text>
